ADDITIONAL NOTICE — FINANCIAL RISK

This Software places orders in live financial markets and can cause real
monetary loss. It is research code, not a product, and carries no guarantee
of correctness.

Nothing in this repository is investment advice, a recommendation, or a
solicitation to trade. The author is not a registered investment adviser.

Backtest results included here are optimistic: universes are built from
current index constituents, so failed companies are absent; several delisted
companies could not be recovered at all; and returns vary materially with the
rebalance start month. Most strategies in this repository failed their own
validation and are retained as controls.

You are solely responsible for any trades placed using this Software, and for
any losses arising from them. Test with paper trading first, and risk only
capital you can afford to lose.
